KZ3 patch 2038 (hooks A/B, RSX pass 37): the in-game Keyboard page.
pad_keybinds.h: page rows/labels, the text command interpreter (pad_kb_ui_command) and the capture of the next
key (pad_kb_ui_step: waits until the opening key is up, Escape cancels, Delete clears, 10 s timeout); cellPad.c:
pad_kb_ui_cmd (locked entry for port/kz3/main.cpp), the capture in the pad poll (keys kept from the game while it
runs and until released), writing keybinds.ini after a change, KZ3_KB_TEST_KEY for Xvfb tests, and the last-device
flag / first key per pad button for keycap prompts (pad_kb_last_device_keyboard, pad_kb_key_for_button).
Pass 38 (UI review): rows carry the game's EButton name (the page shows the game's own action string for the
player's preset, read at run time), plain key names plus a separate "dup" query, "state"/"cf"/"cap"/"hint" for a
footer the page composes, "sel R S" + Delete clears the selected cell outside a capture, an idle line that names the
bound keys.
Host test: tools/smoke/test_pad_keybinds.sh section 5.

